{"id":4460,"date":"2025-03-12T00:10:49","date_gmt":"2025-03-12T00:10:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/?post_type=projects&#038;p=4460"},"modified":"2025-04-16T00:36:54","modified_gmt":"2025-04-16T00:36:54","slug":"contemporary-eco-home-romsey","status":"publish","type":"projects","link":"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/project\/contemporary-eco-home-romsey\/","title":{"rendered":"Contemporary Eco-Home in Romsey, Victoria"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate project-info\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div class=\"grid__details\"\">\n\n                \n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Client<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>Private Residential<\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Timeframe<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2023-2024<\/span><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Contractor<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.blrconstruction.com.au\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BLR Provincial Construction<\/a><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Consultant team<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>Structural &amp; Civil Engineer &#8211; <a href=\"http:\/\/www.adamseng.com.au\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Adams Consulting Engineers<\/a><br \/>\nBuilding Surveyor &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.duchateauchun.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">du Chateau Chun<\/a><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Photographer<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.yelp.com\/biz\/christopher-alexander-photography-blackburn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Christopher Alexander Photography<\/a><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                \n                \n                \n                                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"grid__text\">\n                <p>Located some 63 kilometers from Melbourne, this thoughtfully designed two-storey brick veneer home is located in the picturesque town of Romsey, Victoria.<\/p>\n<p>The contemporary residence not only exemplifies a modern aesthetic but also embodies the commitment of Architecture Matters to sustainable living, making the home both style and environmental responsibility. In this instance the plan is essentially made-up pf two pavilions joined together with an encompassing first floor element providing the master bedroom with the associated amenity.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate full-width-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1320\" height=\"880\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A1279-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A1279-1.jpg 1320w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A1279-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A1279-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A1279-1-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1320px) 100vw, 1320px\" \/>    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate block-quote\">\n        <div class=\"max-sm:w-full ml-auto w-1\/2\">\n            <div>\n                <blockquote>\n\n                <p>A key driver behind the design intent was to create a low-maintenance and hassle-free lifestyle. The home minimises upkeep without compromising on style or functionality.<\/p>\n\n                \n                <\/blockquote>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate two-thirds-image\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div>\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"855\" height=\"570\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A0884-2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Contemporary Eco-Home in Romsey dining area\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A0884-2.jpg 855w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A0884-2-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A0884-2-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 855px) 100vw, 855px\" \/>            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate two-columns-text-image\">\n        \n        \n        \n        \n        <div class=\"grid mt-[30px] md:mt-[50px]\">\n\n            <div class=\"grid__text space-y-12\">\n                                <div><p>The heart of the home is an open plan pavilion featuring an expansive open-plan layout that seamlessly integrates the living, dining, and kitchen areas along with a home office that is located adjacent to the front door. Polished concrete floors enhance the living space, creating a sophisticated yet inviting atmosphere perfect for entertaining.<\/p>\n<p>ESD is inherent in the DNA of this home which utalises the northern aspect of the site and incorporates double-glazed windows and electric floor heating, ensuring optimal energy efficiency throughout the year. The strategic installation of solar panels with a battery system further reduces the home\u2019s environmental impact while providing significant energy savings.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"grid__image\">\n                 <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"439\" height=\"620\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A1401-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A1401-1.jpg 439w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A1401-1-212x300.jpg 212w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 439px) 100vw, 439px\" \/>            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate full-width-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1320\" height=\"880\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A0709-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Contemporary Eco-Home in Romsey al fresco area\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A0709-1.jpg 1320w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A0709-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A0709-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/43A0709-1-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1320px) 100vw, 1320px\" \/>    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate project-carousel\">\n\n        <div class=\"swiper swiper-block\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                    \n                                        \n                        <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"962\" height=\"641\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2